      "body": "Thanks, both right. `PruneOneBlockFile()` clears `BLOCK_HAVE_UNDO`, so the `IsBlockPruned()` check added nothing. It now uses `CheckBlockDataAvailability(*pblockindex, *pblockindex, BlockStatus{BLOCK_HAVE_UNDO})`, in e8af2c7488925e35ffeaf64e523cef48b70280eb.",
